# 📊 InsightX – Business Intelligence & Sales Analytics Dashboard

> A complete end-to-end Business Intelligence project built using Tableau to analyze sales performance, customer behavior, product insights, seller performance, and geographic trends.

![Tableau](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tableau-Dashboard-blue)
![SQL](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQL-Analytics-orange)
![Data Analytics](https://img.shields.io/badge/Data-Analytics-success)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-Data%20Preparation-yellow)

---

# 📌 Project Overview

InsightX is an interactive Business Intelligence dashboard designed to help stakeholders monitor business performance through executive KPIs, customer analytics, sales trends, geographic insights, and product performance.

The project transforms raw business data into meaningful insights using Tableau dashboards, enabling faster and data-driven decision making.

---

# 🎯 Business Objectives

- Monitor overall business performance
- Analyze revenue trends over time
- Track customer growth and segmentation
- Identify top-performing sellers
- Understand geographic sales distribution
- Evaluate product category performance
- Measure customer satisfaction using ratings
- Support executive-level business decisions

---

# 🛠 Tech Stack

- Tableau Public / Tableau Desktop
- SQL
- Python (Data Preparation)
- CSV Dataset

---

